# Technical Implementation Plan: CraftCanvas Remediation

This plan details the technical steps to resolve the issues identified in the architectural evaluation.

## User Review Required
Please review the order and scope of these tasks. Some tasks (like Alembic migrations) introduce new dependencies (`alembic`) that will require recreating the environment or updating [requirements.txt](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/requirements.txt).

## Proposed Changes

---

### Section 1: Fix Priority Bugs

#### [MODIFY] main.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/main.py)
- Move the `@app.middleware("http")` block out of the [global_exception_handler](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/main.py#60-95) function so it registers properly with FastAPI.

#### [MODIFY] scheduler.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/jobs/scheduler.py)
- In [start_scheduler()](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/jobs/scheduler.py#175-215), add `scheduler.add_job(calendar_sync_job, IntervalTrigger(minutes=60), id="calendar_sync", replace_existing=True)` to ensure the calendar job actually runs.

#### [MODIFY] ai_tools.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
- In [get_courses()](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#485-498), replace `results = session.exec(statement).all()` with `results = session.exec(select(Course).where(Course.user_id == user_id, Course.is_active == True)).all()` (or equivalent logic), since `statement` is undefined.

---

### Section 2: Backend Refactoring ([ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py))

The 1,926-line [ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py) will be split into a package: `backend/services/ai_tools/`.

#### [NEW] ai_tools/__init__.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools/__init__.py)
- Aggregate all tool functions into a single `TOOL_DEFINITIONS` list to expose to [ai_service.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_service.py) without breaking existing imports.

#### [NEW] ai_tools/courses.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools/courses.py)
- Move [get_courses](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#485-498), [get_module_details](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#499-525), [get_module_files](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#526-581), [list_course_folders](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#583-613), [search_announcements](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#360-397).

#### [NEW] ai_tools/tasks.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools/tasks.py)
- Move [search_tasks](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#117-185), [get_task_stats](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#186-214), [create_task](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#698-741), [update_task](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#742-770), [delete_task](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#771-785), [search_assignments](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#215-264), [update_assignment](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#786-811).

#### [NEW] ai_tools/materials.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools/materials.py)
- Move [search_module_materials](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#398-482) (RAG), [get_file_metadata](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#615-648), [verify_file_exists](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#650-673), [search_craft_docs](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#675-689).

#### [NEW] ai_tools/misc.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools/misc.py)
- Move [get_timetable](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#265-285), [search_notes](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#286-306), [create_note](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#307-333), [update_note](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#334-359), [ui_navigate](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#690-697).

#### [DELETE] ai_tools.py (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
- Remove the monolith file.
- Update imports in [backend/services/ai_service.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_service.py) to point to `from services.ai_tools import TOOL_DEFINITIONS`.

---

### Section 3: Frontend Refactoring ([page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/page.tsx))

The 730-line dashboard will be refactored by moving logical chunks of state and `useEffect`s into custom hooks.

#### [NEW] useDashboardData.ts (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/hooks/useDashboardData.ts)
- Will encapsulate state for [tasks](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#117-185), [assignments](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py#194-301), [announcements](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py#303-375), `allCourses`, and [brief](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/jobs/scheduler.py#21-45).
- Will export a `refreshData` function and loading states.

#### [NEW] useDashboardChat.ts (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/hooks/useDashboardChat.ts)
- Will track `chatMessages`, `chatInput`, `chatLoading`.
- Will expose [handleChatSend](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/page.tsx#372-439) and [handleClearChat](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/page.tsx#440-450) using the API streaming utility.

#### [NEW] useDashboardTimetable.ts (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/hooks/useDashboardTimetable.ts)
- Will encapsulate `todaySlots` state, `activeLookahead`, and the logic that iterates over following days when today has no classes.

#### [MODIFY] page.tsx (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/page.tsx)
- Import the new hooks to sharply reduce component size.
- Retain only local UI state (like `isEditing`, `isManageModules`, `isTriageOpen`) and render logic.

---

### Section 4: Database Migrations (Alembic)

#### [NEW] alembic.ini & alembic/ (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/alembic.ini)
- Run `alembic init alembic`.
- Modify `alembic/env.py` to import SQLModel and all model definitions so it can auto-generate migrations.
- Create an initial migration that matches current production SQLite schema.

---

### Section 5: DevOps & CI/CD Setup

#### [NEW] Backend Dockerfile (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/Dockerfile)
- Python 3.11 slim image.
- Installs requirements, runs Uvicorn.

#### [NEW] Frontend Dockerfile (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/Dockerfile)
- Node 20 alpine image.
- Runs `npm ci` and `npm run build`.

#### [NEW] ci.yml (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/.github/workflows/ci.yml)
- Basic GitHub Actions workflow to check Python types/lint, run tests, and build both Docker images on PR to ensure sanity.

#### [MODIFY] .gitignore (file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/.gitignore)
- Add `*.bak` and relevant ignore paths.
